  "pages": [
    {
      "name": "home",
      "route": "/",
      "url": "https://stairway.audio/",
      "title": "Stairway Audio. Analog Tone. Digital Soul.",
      "description": "Real analog samples from legendary synthesizers, mapped into lightweight modern plug-ins. Load, play, create.",
      "height": 6232,
      "frame": "home.png",
      "full": "home-full.png",
      "videos": [],
      "phone": {
        "frame": "m-home.png",
        "full": "m-home-full.png",
        "height": 6818
      },
      "text": [
        {
          "tag": "h1",
          "text": "Real analog sound",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "text": "From legendary synthesizers, mapped into lightweight modern plug-ins. Load, play, create.",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h2",
          "text": "For Synths",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h2",
          "text": "Shape every single note.",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "text": "Full ADSR envelope control puts you in charge of how every sound breathes. Set the Attack for a slow swell or a sharp hit. Dial the Decay and Sustain to control how notes hold. Adjust Release for short staccato stabs or long, fading tails.",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "text": "No menu diving. Just four knobs and total control.",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h2",
          "text": "More than just a preset.",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "text": "Four built-in effects (Drive, Phaser, Delay, and Reverb) turn any patch into something entirely new. Push a clean pad into saturation. Add phaser movement to a static lead. Layer delay and reverb for ambient soundscapes that fill every corner of the mix.",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "text": "Add some grit to make your DAW proud.",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h2",
          "text": "Explore SA-S1",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h3",
          "text": "Preset Browser",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "text": "Browse all 61 presets from a dropdown menu. Select from Bass, Leads, FX, Pads, and Plucks categories. Use the arrow buttons to flip through sounds instantly while you play.",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "text": "Play it right here in the page. The real presets, the real signal chain.",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h2",
          "text": "Our Plugins",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h2",
          "text": "SA-S1",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h2",
          "text": "Community",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "text": "Producers are building with Stairway every day. Join the community for first access to new plugins, sample packs, and behind-the-scenes drops.",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "blockquote",
          "text": "“These are the most usable analog samples I've touched. Dropped SA-S1 on a pad bus and instantly had that OB-Xa width.”",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "blockquote",
          "text": "“SA-S2 nails the Minilogue grit without the menu diving. It's basically my go-to for lo-fi keys now.”",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "blockquote",
          "text": "“I wasn't expecting a plugin at this price to sound this expensive. The release tails are gorgeous.”",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "blockquote",
          "text": "“Finally, analog character that doesn't melt my CPU. Ten instances open and my laptop didn't blink.”",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "blockquote",
          "text": "“The presets are actually usable out of the box. Half my last beat is just SA-S1 with the drive turned up.”",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "blockquote",
          "text": "“Bought both on a whim and they've been in every session since. The VU meter is a nice touch, too.”",
          "where": "main"
        }
      ],
